{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline","title":"流水线篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"experiment-tracking-mlflow3","title":"实验追踪与 MLflow 3","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/experiment-tracking-mlflow3","wordCount":1020,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-orchestration","title":"流水线编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/pipeline-orchestration","wordCount":1099,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-for-ml","title":"ML 持续集成与交付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/pipeline/ci-cd-for-ml","wordCount":1066,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"流水线篇\">流水线篇</h1><p>流水线是 MLOps 平台的骨架——它把数据准备、模型训练、评估验证、打包注册这些离散步骤编排为可重放、可审计的自动化工作流。本章覆盖三个核心能力：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>实验追踪与模型注册</strong>：以 MLflow 3 为主线，讲解如何将实验元数据、模型产物、GenAI 追踪统一管理。</li>\n<li><strong>流水线编排</strong>：对比 Kubeflow Pipelines、ZenML、Airflow 等编排方案，理解 DAG 设计与调度策略。</li>\n<li><strong>ML CI/CD</strong>：将软件工程的持续集成/交付实践适配到模型开发，打造从代码提交到模型部署的闭环。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>完成本章后，你应能设计一条从实验到注册的端到端自动化流水线。</p>\n"}